  <section id="sec:triangulos">
    <title>Triângulos retângulos</title>
    Seja $a < b$. Então:
    <theorem id="thm:pitagoras">
      <title>Pitágoras</title>
      <equation id="eq:pitagoras">a^2 + b^2 = c^2</equation>
    </theorem>
